        "cabinet": {
          "_": "A cabinet on the bottom rung (Matt, 13 Nov 2026), on a bracket each side: an OUTER bracket where the cabinet ends, ONE EXTENSION bracket on a ladder two cabinets share (MA 406214 p.1, step 1b). The bay's own shelf moves up a rung to make room.",
