        "desk": {
          "_": "The office solution (Office solution sheet): a base bracket on each ladder at rung 3 - rungs 1 and 2 are drawn red - an arm bolted flat to it, a clamping angle on the arm's rear end, and the desktop laid across the two arms. The arm's hole row is chosen so the desk top is 750 mm: the lower row on 100 mm feet (sheet fig. 3), the upper row standing on the floor or the wall (fig. 2).",
          "rung": 3,
          "brackets": {
            "end": "008551-base-brackets-for-office-solution"
          },
