          "_heldBack": "Not offered yet (13 Nov 2026). Built and tried: brackets, arms and clamping angles all fit, but the desktop cannot go on, because one clamping angle stands inside the board - audit F18. The arm is a handed part and we hold one hand of the pair (project doc 5.13). The adds go back in - desk-600 and desk-700 on every d320 size, group accessories, max 1, perBay - when Kesseboehmer answer which way it is handed."
